---
id: sweet-corn-and-green-peas
title: Sweet Corn & Green Peas
category: modular_carb

yield:
  servings: 1
  cooked_g: 280

storage:
  fridge_days: 4
  freezer_friendly: true

---

Heat a dry #skillet over medium-high heat until hot.

Add @frozen-sweet-corn{1%cup} and @frozen-green-peas{1%cup} directly to the pan straight from frozen—no cooking oil is required.

Sauté undisturbed for ~sear-time{90%sec} to develop light surface blistering and char. Toss and stir continuously for another ~finish-time{90%sec} until completely thawed, piping hot, and lightly sweet-toasty.

(Microwave alternative: combine the corn and peas in a microwave-safe bowl with 1 tbsp water. Cover with a vented lid and microwave on high for ~steam-time{2.5%min}, then drain any excess moisture).

Transfer the hot vegetable blend (280 g cooked yield) directly into a meal prep container and let cool before sealing.
